msgstr ""
"Le Proton pointé par PROTONPATH semble incomplet. Vérifie l'installation de "
"Proton-GE (`stalker-gamma-linux prefix-doctor`)."

msgid ""
"umu-run not found in PATH. Install umu-launcher (see `stalker-gamma-linux "
